<title>USA: Multi-Market says agrees to settle suit.</title>
<headline>Multi-Market says agrees to settle suit.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Multi-Market Radio Inc said on Tuesday it agreed to settle a lawsuit filed against the company by a shareholder seeking to prevent the proposed merger into SFX Broadcasting Inc.</p>
<p>The company said that on September 25 it entered into a memorandum of understanding, which constituted an agreement in principle to settle the suit.</p>
<p>Under the settlement, Multi-Market said stockholders would receive a consideration of at least $12.50 per share in the merger if the price of SFX Class A common stock during the specified valuation period was not less than $32 per share.</p>
</text>
